    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42288" root="وكت" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُكْتَةٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْضَةُ زَنْدٍ</span> (K: in the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْضة</span>)
[app., The <i>notch in a wooden instrument for
striking fire;</i> as understood by Golius: but
accord. to the TA, the <i>notch,</i> or <i>the like, in the
